    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to simply survive as you explore in this Metroidvania game. This game features more than 50 levels each with different themes like forests and rock quarries. Checkpoints are important to save your progress. Enemies and bosses require learning their attack patterns to defeat them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/e8f1cef8931d667c4b3fc47b5bff40ce.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Game design inspired by 1990s 16-bit classics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Pixel art graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Side-scrolling gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf One player platforming action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/c705cab861e33b4aa900a8410a7eef01.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support. Automatically detects connected controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/8fd73b9916212d9f8ab1af133982a704.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/6d81c2a4306bd86546ad9f175da4b610.poster.avif?t=1744472310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/6d81c2a4306bd86546ad9f175da4b610.webp?t=1744472310\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/4f890e41b2bd5805d93aeda096f3e317.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Shoot the walls for hidden areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Water drains your health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Save Progress in Hub Rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to simply survive as you explore in this Metroidvania game. This game features more than 50 levels each with different themes like forests and rock quarries. Checkpoints are important to save your progress. Enemies and bosses require learning their attack patterns to defeat them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/e8f1cef8931d667c4b3fc47b5bff40ce.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Game design inspired by 1990s 16-bit classics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Pixel art graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Side-scrolling gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf One player platforming action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/5ea99226a9258584dacc369b4a030841.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/c705cab861e33b4aa900a8410a7eef01.webp?t=1744472310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support. Automatically detects connected controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cla